    "detailed_description": "Soma Cube is a challenging 3D puzzle game also known as &quot;Soma Cube Puzzle&quot;. The main goal of the game is to use a series of differently shaped blocks to piece together a complete 3D shape.<br />\r\nThe blocks in the game have different shapes and sizes, and players must think strategically to gradually assemble them. The challenge of Soma Cube lies in correctly matching the shapes and angles of each block in order to piece together a complete 3D structure.<br />\r\nSoma Cube game demands high levels of spatial thinking and problem-solving skills from players. It requires observation, experimentation, and adjustment to find the correct solution. In addition to being challenging, Soma Cube is highly entertaining and engaging, allowing players to immerse themselves in the enjoyable task of problem-solving.<br />\r\nSoma Cube is suitable for players of all ages and can be played alone or together with other players to compete and challenge. Whether you want to exercise your thinking abilities or seek a fun and relaxing activity, Soma Cube is a worthwhile game to try.",
